      "page": 16,
      "quote": "The proposed optimal CNN classification model achieves an average CAR of approximately 95.13%.",
      "statement": "该Mura研究另用CNN进行缺陷分类；不是工厂批次检测结论。",
      "review_status": "SOURCE_VERIFIED",
      "authority_type": "PUBLIC_RESEARCH"
    },
    {
