      "page": 1,
      "quote": "We propose a crosstalk defect detection method based on salient color channel frequency domain filtering.",
      "statement": "论文提出显著颜色通道频域滤波用于串扰缺陷检测。",
      "review_status": "SOURCE_VERIFIED",
      "authority_type": "PUBLIC_RESEARCH"
