      "page": 1,
      "quote": "Secondly, the image color quaternion matrix is converted into the logarithmic spectrum in the frequency domain through the hyper‐complex Fourier transform.",
      "statement": "方法将颜色四元数矩阵经超复数傅里叶变换转换为频域对数谱。",
